{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17407","headline":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌词三首 一 · 权德舆","name":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌词三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"覆露雍熙运，澄清敎化源。\n赓歌凝庶绩，羽舞被深恩。\n纂业光文祖，贻谋属孝孙。\n恭闻留末命，犹是爱元元。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}